{
  "text": "紫微斗數全書",
  "juan": "卷一",
  "section": "重補⽃數彀率",
  "entries": [
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L000",
      "original_quote": "重補⽃數彀率",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L001",
      "original_quote": "重補⽃數彀率諸星吉多逢凶也吉,諸星惡多逢吉也凶｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L002",
      "original_quote": "星更纏度,數分定局｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L003",
      "original_quote": "重在看星得垣受制,⽅可論⼈禍福窮通｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L004",
      "original_quote": "⼤概以⾝命為禍福之柄,以根源為窮通之機｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L005",
      "original_quote": "紫微在命輔弼同垣,其貴必矣,財印夾命⽇⽉夾財,其富何疑｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L006",
      "original_quote": "蔭福臨不怕凶沖,⽇⽉會不如合照｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L007",
      "original_quote": "貪狼居⼦乃為泛⽔桃花,天刑遭貪必主風流刑杖｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L008",
      "original_quote": "紫微坐命庫則⽇⾦轝捧櫛輦,臨官安⽂曜號為衣錦惹天香｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L009",
      "original_quote": "太陰合⽂曲於妻宮翰林清異,太陽會⽂昌於官祿⾦殿傳臚｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L010",
      "original_quote": "祿合守⽥財為爛穀堆⾦,財蔭居遷移為⾼商豪客｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L011",
      "original_quote": "耗居敗地沿途丐求,貪會旺宮終⾝鼠竊｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L012",
      "original_quote": "殺居絕地⽣成三⼗⼆之顏回,⽇在旺宮可學⼋百年之彭祖｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L013",
      "original_quote": "巨暗同垣於⾝命疾厄贏瘦其軀,凶星交會於相貌遷移傷刑其⾯｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L014",
      "original_quote": "⼤耗會廉貞於官祿枷杻囚徒,官符會刑殺於遷移離鄉遠配｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L015",
      "original_quote": "七殺臨於陷地流年必⾒死亡,耗殺忌逢破軍火鈴嫌逢太歲｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L016",
      "original_quote": "奏書博⼠並流祿以盡乎吉祥,⼒⼠將軍與⻘⿓以顯其威福｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L017",
      "original_quote": "童⼦限弱⽔上浮泡,老⼈限衰風中燃燭｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L018",
      "original_quote": "遇殺必驚,流年最緊｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    },
    {
      "line_id": "ZWQS_Juan1_Gulu_L019",
      "original_quote": "⼈⽣發達限元最怕浮沉,⼀世迍邅命限逢乎駁雜｡",
      "tag": [],
      "paragraph_index": 0
    }
  ],
  "_source": {
